      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this well maintained A Rated 3 bedroom, 3 bathroom family home to the market located on Shackleton Terrace, Lucan. The property itself is situated in an ideal spot within the development as it overlooks a green space with minimal passing traffic. This sought after development is peaceful and home to many growing families and boasts close proximity to Lucan Village, placing an abundance of local amenities right on your doorstep. Within walking distance, you will discover bars, shops, schools and sporting facilities. Liffey Valley Shopping Centre is just a short drive away and the N4/M50 road networks and Adamstown Train Station make commuting and access to the City Centre easy.\r\n\r\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c.112 sq. m comprises of an entrance hallway with bright living room to the front, understairs storage and a guest W.C, leading to the open-plan kitchen/diner flooded with natural light with a separate utility room. To the rear, there is a sunny garden which benefits from patio. The first floor hosts three bedrooms, including a spacious master with en-suite, together with the main family bathroom and storage closet.\r\n\r\nNo. 20 comes to the market in Turn Key condition throughout and further benefits from an A Ber rating, built in wardrobes throughout, designated parking, sunny rear garden and floored attic space with built in ladder. Based on recent success in this development, we know this property will be very popular so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers at your earliest convenience to register your interest or to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nFeatures;\r\n- c. 112 sq.m\r\n- 3 BED / 3 BATH\r\n- A3 BER rating\r\n- Still within new build home warranty\r\n- Sunny rear garden\r\n- Built in wardrobes\r\n- Pristine condition from top to bottom\r\n- Flooded with natural light\r\n- Allocated parking for two cars\r\n- Ample built in storage space\r\n- All essential amenities in close proximity\r\n- Creche and playground within the development\r\n- Adamstown train station within easy reach\r\n- Direct access onto the N4\r\n- Ideal for first time buyers, growing families and investors\r\n- Viewing highly advised"
      },
